{"t": 1792646291528, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "members_unreachable", "Members of my own nation (Bella Jones, Ruth Walker, Charlie Thompson) stand 1.4-3.6m from me, up to ~10m outside my settlement's well. Over 10 tries, G always said 'There is no one within reach to give a gift to.' Pawns that count as inside a settlement are skipped, so I couldn't befriend my own people to shape who becomes heir. The HUD doesn't say why, and the members aren't listed anywhere either (the Nations panel shows only '4 members'), so a player can't see or influence the line of succession. tick ~18000"]}
