{"t": 1792646374919, "cmd": "note", "args": ["Laws tab: the line under each law describes only the law in force. With Taxes: None and High pending, it still reads 'No tax: members keep their coin.', so a player can't find out what Low or High do (coin rate, loyalty cost, immigration) until 30 s after enacting one. Hover text or a description per option would help. See laws_high.png (also laws2.png for Low). tick 21261"]}
