{"t": 1792646380165, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "chronicle_noise", "By the end of day 1 the 5-line Chronicle panel scrolls with AI rivalries, stalls and nations falling (~20 nations founded and several disbanded in the first in-game day). My own law changes, like 'Taxes were lifted in Farmfield', go off the panel within seconds. They are highlighted, which helps, but with so much noise statecraft is easy to miss; the status bar shows only one of two laws that took effect on the same tick (15501). tick ~24000"]}
